# STACKONE

### One workspace. Every developer tool.

STACKONE is a lightweight, browser-based developer toolkit that brings six practical utilities together in one clean, responsive interface.

## Features

| Tool | Description |
|---|---|
| JSON Formatter | Format, validate and explore JSON with a tree view |
| Base64 Encoder / Decoder | Encode and decode text, including Unicode |
| Password Checker | Evaluate password strength using multiple checks |
| Case Converter | Convert text between common naming conventions |
| Word Counter | Analyze words, characters, sentences and reading time |
| UUID Generator | Generate UUID v4 identifiers |

## Built With

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Vanilla JavaScript
- Browser Web APIs

No frameworks, external libraries, CDNs or backend services are required.

## Getting Started

1. Clone or download this repository.
2. Open `index.html` in a modern web browser.
3. Select a tool from the sidebar.
4. Start using the utilities.

## Privacy

STACKONE is designed to work locally in your browser. It does not require an account or backend service. Password input is not saved to browser storage.

